      "evidence": "Windows tests fvf_decl_management843-925 pin shared declaration identities and public counts across FVF switches; tests803-833 require converted layouts and zero-FVF successful no-op preserving a user declaration. Reverse conversion of user POSITION/POSITIONT-only declarations is a separate todo_wine branch and remains outside this phase."
    },
    {
