      "evidence": "device_get_fvf_declaration3563+ caches exact FVFs with private WineD3D holds, drops public declaration count to zero and releases parent pin. SetFVF3630+ treats zero as a successful no-op. GetFVF3657+ reads declaration-associated FVF. Device.Release734+ drains cached holds only on final public lifetime."
    },
